**변경 사항**
- [tools/post-impl-verify.py](/mnt/d/dev-base/.gran-maestro/worktrees/REQ-034-task-01/tools/post-impl-verify.py:64)
  - `--spec` 자동 탐색 제거, 미지정+`--no-figma` 미사용 시 즉시 `exit=1` + `[FATAL] --spec is required` 처리([569](/mnt/d/dev-base/.gran-maestro/worktrees/REQ-034-task-01/tools/post-impl-verify.py:569)).
  - semantic `MAJOR`도 blocking으로 반영 (`blocking = critical > 0 or major > 0 ...`)([368](/mnt/d/dev-base/.gran-maestro/worktrees/REQ-034-task-01/tools/post-impl-verify.py:368)).
  - `exit=2`일 때 의미 안내 라인 추가: `[INFO] exit=2 means PASS-with-IGNORE-only (사용자 검수 권장)`([539](/mnt/d/dev-base/.gran-maestro/worktrees/REQ-034-task-01/tools/post-impl-verify.py:539)).

- [tools/repair-from-violations.py](/mnt/d/dev-base/.gran-maestro/worktrees/REQ-034-task-01/tools/repair-from-violations.py:299)
